 UnderlyingSource.autoAllocateChunkSize is too large on 32-bit build.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D229811\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D230269", "files": ["dom/streams/ReadableByteStreamController.cpp", "dom/streams/test/xpcshell/xpcshell.toml"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "1e54f031c7bfa2d1d5d7b0b47ff965606f805d79", "parents": ["9d3d05929884b4d1262cae632a905123d00fd925"], "tags": []}], "date": 1733425961, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "299": {"changesets": [{"author": "Andrew Osmond \u003caosmond@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1874523.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D227304\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D229973", "files": ["image/AnimationFrameBuffer.cpp", "image/Decoder.cpp", "image/imgFrame.cpp", "image/imgFrame.h", "image/test/gtest/TestAnimationFrameBuffer.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "093e7d8bd0524f636f94aa7b0498f461c50c1b1e", "parents": ["1e54f031c7bfa2d1d5d7b0b47ff965606f805d79"], "tags": []}], "date": 1733426046, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "300": {"changesets": [{"author": "Andrew Osmond \u003caosmond@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1926454.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D229928\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D230334", "files": ["dom/base/StructuredCloneHolder.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "63a60ddc7f33312874973f54632e02c07e28fce5", "parents": ["093e7d8bd0524f636f94aa7b0498f461c50c1b1e"], "tags": []}], "date": 1733426170, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "301": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mike Hommey \u003cmh+mozilla@glandium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1933835 - Allow to install deb package on systems with libgdk-pixbuf-2.0-0 instead of libgdk-pixbuf2.0-0.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D230470\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D230641", "files": ["taskcluster/docker/debian-repackage/Dockerfile"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "5011b537ffa4c114f85bcf71f6360d71dc703228", "parents": ["63a60ddc7f33312874973f54632e02c07e28fce5"], "tags": []}], "date": 1733427033, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "302": {"changesets": [{"author": "Andr\u00e9 Bargull \u003candre.bargull@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1933023 - Check whether the segment's chars are Latin1 instead of the JS string. r=anba a=RyanVM\n\nThis also has the patch for bug 1928407 folded into it.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D230374", "files": ["js/src/builtin/intl/Segmenter.cpp", "js/src/builtin/intl/Segmenter.h", "js/src/jit-test/tests/auto-regress/bug1928407.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "0a63d2eb669e570fa2d5bb59a3c078f288e415e5", "parents": ["5011b537ffa4c114f85bcf71f6360d71dc703228"], "tags": []}], "date": 1733427702, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "303": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mike Hommey \u003cmh+mozilla@glandium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1906930 - Fix SrcRepository.get_files when the SrcRepository is given a path other than the current directory.  a=pascalc\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D216502\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D231335", "files": ["python/mozversioncontrol/mozversioncontrol/__init__.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "ac0b3057170ef95c6751778048321fe0999ad338", "parents": ["0a63d2eb669e570fa2d5bb59a3c078f288e415e5"], "tags": []}], "date": 1733477892, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "304": {"changesets": [{"author": "Valentin Gosu \u003cvalentin.gosu@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1932308 - Add pref for sending HTTP/2 PRIORITY_UPDATE frames  a=pascalc\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D230522\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D231070", "files": ["modules/libpref/init/StaticPrefList.yaml", "netwerk/protocol/http/Http2StreamBase.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "e51dd84a065cbd32f8fbef4a09bdab95eb244514", "parents": ["ac0b3057170ef95c6751778048321fe0999ad338"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Valentin Gosu \u003cvalentin.gosu@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1932308 - Do not send PRIORITY_UPDATE H2 frames  a=pascalc\n\nAs far as I can tell, this problem occurs regardless of what is\nin the PRIORITY_UPDATE frames. I suspect the connection gets closed by\nthe server because it's receiving a lot of HTTP/2 frames it does not\nunderstand, and treats these as a DoS attack.\n\nI've also tried to convince Chrome to generate a PRIORITY_UPDATE frame\nbut I was unsuccessful.\n\nMy suggestion is to disable sending PRIORITY_UPDATE for now.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D230929\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D231071", "files": ["modules/libpref/init/StaticPrefList.yaml"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "451cbdba35553177c957fdee52b9e7694dd443e9", "parents": ["e51dd84a065cbd32f8fbef4a09bdab95eb244514"], "tags": []}], "date": 1733478018, "git_changesets": [null, null], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "305": {"changesets": [{"author": "Dave Townsend \u003cdtownsend@oxymoronical.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1933261: Fix the profile missing and downgrade UIs to not hang on startup.  a=pascalc\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D230256\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D230964", "files": ["toolkit/xre/nsAppRunner.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "821efd131ba3e03a51bf499299b3e8d132f1e72a", "parents": ["451cbdba35553177c957fdee52b9e7694dd443e9"], "tags": []}], "date": 1733478116, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "306": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-esr128 repo-update HSTS HPKP remote-settings tld-suffixes -  a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D231521", "files": ["netwerk/dns/effective_tld_names.dat", "security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "eac0d4dfbeaaf7375b2fb0912d02401a5735660c", "parents": ["821efd131ba3e03a51bf499299b3e8d132f1e72a"], "tags": []}], "date": 1733793765, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "307": {"changesets": [{"author": "Nika Layzell \u003cnika@thelayzells.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1931873 - Use WeakPtr in MIDIAccess, r=gsvelto a=RyanVM\n\nThe WeakPtr type simplifies the situation if the `MIDIPort` object\noutlives its `MIDIAccess`.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D230812", "files": ["dom/midi/MIDIAccess.cpp", "dom/midi/MIDIAccess.h", "dom/midi/MIDIPort.cpp", "dom/midi/MIDIPort.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "ddbdf5d4149ce10bfa105bd3754f1df270f7ab13", "parents": ["eac0d4dfbeaaf7375b2fb0912d02401a5735660c"], "tags": []}], "date": 1733795041, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "308": {"changesets": [{"author": "Frederik Braun \u003cfb@frederik-braun.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1915257 - refactor webchannel to use actor's principal r=nalexander,nika a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D227161", "files": ["toolkit/actors/WebChannelChild.sys.mjs", "toolkit/actors/WebChannelParent.sys.mjs"], "git_node": null, "git_pare